---
/**
 * 01 · agent mode — the one beat that has to be a real screenshot.
 *
 * Everything else on this page is an argument (no cloud, any model, forkable)
 * and arguments are better as design elements. This is the product *doing*
 * something: the agent proposing a change as a reviewable diff. No mockup can
 * carry that, so it gets the photograph.
 */
---

<section id="agent">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 · agent mode</p>
      <h2 class="section-h">An agent that writes code, in your terminal.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Ask for a change and it comes back as a diff you review — accept, refine, or edit. Run by
        the model you chose, on your own hardware. The same Agent Mode as Warp, without the account
        or the relay.
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="agent-shot">
      <img
        src="/shots/agent.png"
        alt="Uncaged's agent proposing a new Rust file as a reviewable diff, with Accept, Refine and Edit controls"
        width="1600"
        height="1040"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>

    <ul class="agent-notes">
      <li><b>Reviewable, not automatic.</b> Nothing lands until you accept it.</li>
      <li><b>Tools run locally.</b> Your shell, your files, your MCP servers.</li>
      <li><b>Any backend.</b> A local model, an API key, or a CLI agent you already pay for.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sec-head {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .sec-head .eyebrow {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .sec-head .section-h {
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .sec-head .section-sub {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .agent-shot {
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: min(940px, 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--bar);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #10141c;
    box-shadow: 0 32px 80px -28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
  }

  .agent-shot img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .agent-notes {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: min(940px, 100%);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .agent-notes li {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ash);
  }

  .agent-notes b {
    display: block;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .agent-notes {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
